{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今晚六合彩攪珠，自動攪珠機懷疑故障，要轉用後備攪珠機。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">晚上九時半舉行的六合彩攪珠，彩球在攪珠機滾動停止後，未有如常升起幸運號碼彩球，攪珠隨即暫停。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">監場嘉賓見證下　換後備機重新攪珠</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在兩名監場嘉賓見證下，改用現場另一部後備攪珠機，將新一套彩球放入機內，之後重新攪珠。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">今次是馬會在5月轉用第五代攪珠機後，第一次故障。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HKJC-2230_002.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026OLGG2FVgrK1789225468.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HKJC-2230_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HKJC-2230_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026UVGIVQ6sRK1789225478.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.HKJC-2230_003.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T15:19:31.769530+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}